# Build context filter for the images in this directory.
#
# The build context is the REPOSITORY ROOT (compose sets `context: ..`), so this
# file only applies when someone builds with `infra/` as the context. The copies
# named Dockerfile.web.dockerignore / Dockerfile.relay.dockerignore are what
# BuildKit actually reads for the root-context builds — it resolves an ignore
# file next to the Dockerfile before falling back to the context root, and a
# root-level .dockerignore belongs to no lane. deploy.sh asserts the three stay
# identical.

# Never in an image, under any circumstances.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.key
**/*.pem
**/age.key
**/*.dec.yaml
infra/secrets

# Reinstalled from the lockfile inside the build; copying host trees in would
# both bloat the context and risk platform-specific binaries.
**/node_modules
.pnpm-store

# Build output — regenerated in the image.
**/.next
**/dist
**/build
**/out
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Test and tooling artefacts.
**/coverage
**/.nyc_output
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/.vitest
**/.turbo

# Not needed to build or run anything.
.git
.github
.husky
.agents
.vscode
.idea
docs
infra
**/*.md
!README.md
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
